#: ../../data_center.rst:3
msgid "\"Data-Center MSP-Hosted\" Quick Start"
msgstr "\"Data-Center MSP-Hosted\" Hurtig start"

#: ../../data_center.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduktion"

#: ../../data_center.rst:8
msgid ""
"If you are a managed service provider who manages hundreds or thousands "
"of end points across multiple clients, it is a good option that you setup"
" CentreStack server in a data center."
msgstr "Hvis du er en administreret tjenesteudbyder, der administrerer hundreder eller tusinder af endepunkter på tværs af flere klienter, er det en god mulighed, at du opsætter CentreStack-server i et datacenter."

#: ../../data_center.rst:11
msgid ""
"There are a couple advantages of setting the CentreStack server up in a "
"data center:"
msgstr "Der er et par fordele ved at opsætte CentreStack-serveren i et datacenter:"

#: ../../data_center.rst:13
msgid ""
"The data center is closer to the Internet backbone than a business office"
" is, thus it has faster Internet speed."
msgstr "Datacentret er tættere på internettets rygrad end et forretningskontor, og derfor har det hurtigere internethastighed."

#: ../../data_center.rst:14
msgid ""
"Setting it up in a central location and in a multi-tenant fashion is "
"easier to manage as compared to a one-centrestack-instance-per-client "
"setup."
msgstr "At konfigurere det på et centralt sted og på en multi-tenant måde er lettere at administrere sammenlignet med en opsætning med én CentreStack-instans per klient."

#: ../../data_center.rst:20
msgid "Preparation"
msgstr "Forberedelse"

#: ../../data_center.rst:22
msgid ""
"The preparation step is very similar to the On-Premise Self-Hosted "
"version of CentreStack."
msgstr "Forberedelsestrinnet er meget lig On-Premise Self-Hosted versionen af CentreStack."

#: ../../data_center.rst:24
msgid "When it comes to choosing a data center, you have several options:"
msgstr "Når det kommer til valg af datacenter, har du flere muligheder:"

#: ../../data_center.rst:26
msgid "A local data center you already use for hosting"
msgstr "Et lokalt datacenter, som du allerede bruger til hosting"

#: ../../data_center.rst:27
msgid "Amazon EC2 data center"
msgstr "Amazon EC2-datacenter"

#: ../../data_center.rst:28
msgid "Azure Compute data center"
msgstr "Azure Compute-datacenter"

#: ../../data_center.rst:29
msgid "Any other data center that provides Windows Server"
msgstr "Enhver anden datacenter, der leverer Windows Server"

#: ../../data_center.rst:32
msgid ""
"The CentreStack server is a web server, passing file and folder access "
"between remote client agents to backend file servers. Here are a list of "
"items to prepare ahead of time:"
msgstr "CentreStack-serveren er en webserver, der formidler fil- og mappeadgang mellem fjerne klientagenter og backend-filservere. Her er en liste over ting, der skal forberedes på forhånd:"

#: ../../data_center.rst:35
msgid "A dedicated Windows Server machine:"
msgstr "En dedikeret Windows Server-maskine:"

#: ../../data_center.rst:37
msgid "Operating System (2025 / 2022 / 2019)"
msgstr "Operativsystem (2025 / 2022 / 2019)"

#: ../../data_center.rst:38
msgid "8G memory"
msgstr "8G hukommelse"

#: ../../data_center.rst:39
msgid "Dual core or more cores (vCPU or CPU)"
msgstr "Dual core eller flere kerner (vCPU eller CPU)"

#: ../../data_center.rst:40
msgid "100G hard drive space."
msgstr "100G harddiskplads."

#: ../../data_center.rst:42
msgid "A SSL certificate (for production)"
msgstr "Et SSL-certifikat (til produktion)"

#: ../../data_center.rst:43
msgid "A DNS name (for production)"
msgstr "Et DNS-navn (til produktion)"

#: ../../data_center.rst:45
msgid ""
"Since you can turn a test (POC) environment directly into a production "
"environment, you can start with requirement #1  for test and POC (proof "
"of concept) environment and later acquire SSL certificate and DNS name."
msgstr "Da du kan omdanne et test (POC) miljø direkte til et produktionsmiljø, kan du starte med krav #1 for test og POC (proof of concept) miljø og senere anskaffe SSL-certifikat og DNS-navn."

#: ../../data_center.rst:49
msgid ""
"In Amazon EC2 or Azure Compute, you will need to find the virtual machine"
" images that are similar to the specificication."
msgstr "I Amazon EC2 eller Azure Compute skal du finde de virtuelle maskinbilleder, der ligner specifikationen."

#: ../../data_center.rst:53
msgid "Download & Install"
msgstr "Download & Installér"

#: ../../data_center.rst:55
msgid ""
"After you decide and have acquired the Windows Server (Usually a virtual "
"machine in a data center) to install the CentreStack software, you can go"
" to the partner portal and download the software."
msgstr "Når du har besluttet dig for og anskaffet Windows Serveren (normalt en virtuel maskine i et datacenter) til at installere CentreStack-softwaren, kan du gå til partnerportalen og downloade softwaren."

#: ../../data_center.rst:60
msgid "The Installer will install everything from beginning to end."
msgstr "Installationsprogrammet vil installere alt fra begyndelsen til slutningen."

#: ../../data_center.rst:65
msgid "Please reference the following two guides for more information:"
msgstr "Henvis venligst til de følgende to vejledninger for mere information:"

#: ../../data_center.rst:67
msgid ""
"`Deployment Guide "
"<http://www.centrestack.com/Library/DeploymentGuide/index.html>`_"
msgstr "`Udrulningsguide <http://www.centrestack.com/Library/DeploymentGuide/index.html>`_"

#: ../../data_center.rst:68
msgid ""
"`Installation Guide "
"<http://www.centrestack.com/Library/InstallGuide/index.html>`_"
msgstr "`Installationsguide <http://www.centrestack.com/Library/InstallGuide/index.html>`_"

